{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And you shall make holy garments.</b> They are called so because he serves in them in the holy place, or in the manner of \"and they shall not sanctify the people with their garments\" (Ezekiel 44:19). And all of Aaron's garments that are mentioned:" "<b>For honor and for splendor.</b> That they may glory in them, for there is none among Israel who wears such things:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:44.858589607Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}